\" title=\"2021 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 18 (page does not exist)\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2021 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2021 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 21 (page does not exist)\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 22 (page does not exist)\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 23 (page does not exist)\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 24 (page does not exist)\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 25 (page does not exist)\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018014547\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplicat